AAAI (2021),
and AKBC (2020)

## Teaching & Mentoring

I was a TA for Machine Learning (CS 601.475) at Johns Hopkins University in 2022. I have also mentored:
- - [Jiachen Tu](https://www.linkedin.com/in/jiachentu/), research intern at Microsoft Research, 2025. Now Ph.D. student at UIUC.
- - [Vivek Chari](https://www.linkedin.com/in/vivek-chari-5b931122a), undergraduate student at Johns Hopkins University, 2023. Now Scientist at Microsoft.
- - [Yukun Feng](https://www.linkedin.com/in/yukun-feng-b0569317a/), master's student at Johns Hopkins University, 2022. Now Scientist at Apple.
